WEBVTT

00:00:01.898 --> 00:00:04.734
You think you're hot stuff,
don't you?

00:00:05.568 --> 00:00:07.570
But today, I end you.

00:00:08.947 --> 00:00:10.073
Ora! Ora! Ora! Ora!

00:00:10.198 --> 00:00:11.824
Consecutive low kicks!

00:00:11.908 --> 00:00:13.910
It's a cheese attack combo
I discovered!

00:00:14.702 --> 00:00:17.455
Good grief.
You just don't get it.

00:00:18.081 --> 00:00:19.624
Let me show you...

00:00:19.916 --> 00:00:21.751
...what real "cheese" is.

00:00:30.385 --> 00:00:31.844
K.O.!

00:00:32.095 --> 00:00:36.683
Bunny bunny hop!

00:00:36.766 --> 00:00:37.767
K.O.!

00:00:38.977 --> 00:00:39.936
K.O.!

00:00:41.062 --> 00:00:42.021
K.O.!

00:00:52.448 --> 00:00:53.533
K.O.!

00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:55.994
Bunny bunny hop!

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:57.412
Crap game!

00:00:57.495 --> 00:00:58.746
This is a crapass game!

00:00:58.955 --> 00:01:00.581
NO OTHER WORDS CAME TO MIND.

00:01:02.917 --> 00:01:04.544
Huh? What's this?

00:01:06.629 --> 00:01:10.633
Oh, they gave those out to
a bunch of heroes recently.

00:01:11.009 --> 00:01:12.969
Still a prototype or something.

00:01:14.470 --> 00:01:16.306
It requests backup and
sends your location

00:01:16.431 --> 00:01:17.807
at the touch of a button.

00:01:18.391 --> 00:01:19.475
I didn't get one.

00:01:21.185 --> 00:01:24.480
Oh, maybe they figured
you'd have trouble using it,

00:01:24.564 --> 00:01:26.733
what with the buttons and all.

00:01:29.569 --> 00:01:30.570
We're going again.

00:01:31.237 --> 00:01:34.365
This time my low kicks will be so fast,
I'll beat you for sure!

00:01:50.923 --> 00:01:52.967
Through the once tranquil town

00:01:53.051 --> 00:01:55.303
A thunderous roar peals forth

00:01:55.345 --> 00:01:59.223
Watch out! Freak out! Monsters!

00:02:00.141 --> 00:02:02.226
Who ts going to take the lead

00:02:02.352 --> 00:02:04.729
When we destroy the evil ones?

00:02:04.896 --> 00:02:09.525
Destruction, contusion...
Loosen up!

00:02:09.609 --> 00:02:11.652
We know, We are...

00:02:11.778 --> 00:02:14.280
HEROES!

00:02:14.364 --> 00:02:16.032
Why were you

00:02:16.199 --> 00:02:18.368
born of evil?

00:02:18.493 --> 00:02:20.411
If you wish to know

00:02:20.578 --> 00:02:22.830
I shall tell!

00:02:22.997 --> 00:02:28.878
This night the punching fist
of glorious justice

00:02:29.045 --> 00:02:32.340
Will shatter your fate apart!

00:02:33.633 --> 00:02:38.179
That word exists for you
and you alone

00:02:38.304 --> 00:02:42.892
Raise your silent fist
to the sky!

00:02:43.017 --> 00:02:47.522
The apostle bears
the weight of solitude

00:02:47.688 --> 00:02:53.861
For a peace not tilled
with hatred

00:02:54.028 --> 00:02:57.115
He must fight!

00:03:06.874 --> 00:03:10.128
We received a message
from the Monster Associ—

00:03:11.254 --> 00:03:14.549
We received a message
from the Monster Association.

00:03:16.342 --> 00:03:17.635
Something's taken him over!

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:19.595
Get the heroes stationed
at HQ in here!

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:22.348
This is West Building,
conference room 7!

00:03:22.432 --> 00:03:22.974
Should I fire?

00:03:23.099 --> 00:03:23.891
Shoot it! Shoot it!

00:03:23.975 --> 00:03:24.934
Hold!

00:03:25.435 --> 00:03:26.811
Let's hear the message.

00:03:27.603 --> 00:03:31.899
JUSTICE UNDER SIEGE

00:03:32.567 --> 00:03:36.779
I am Director Gyoro-Gyoro
of the Monster Association.

00:03:37.029 --> 00:03:38.364
We have the son of

00:03:38.448 --> 00:03:41.284
your highest-ranking executive
with us.

00:03:41.784 --> 00:03:42.952
What is it you want?

00:03:43.286 --> 00:03:45.288
We have but one demand.

00:03:45.872 --> 00:03:49.500
We are sick and tired of being
oppressed because we are monsters.

00:03:49.959 --> 00:03:52.628
From this day on,
we wish to be left alone.

00:03:53.463 --> 00:03:56.215
Right now, we hide in
an abandoned area of City Z

00:03:56.382 --> 00:03:59.469
where we eke out a meager
and barren existence together.

00:04:00.011 --> 00:04:01.804
We seek nothing presumptuous

00:04:01.888 --> 00:04:04.182
like leading lives
in the outside world.

00:04:04.474 --> 00:04:07.977
Our offer is to halt our conflict
with ordinary humans

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:10.897
and to cease entering
areas where they live.

00:04:11.522 --> 00:04:12.815
In exchange,

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:16.360
we want you to guarantee us
a safe place to live.

00:04:16.986 --> 00:04:19.739
All we hope for is
the realization of a society

00:04:19.822 --> 00:04:22.450
where humans and monsters
can coexist.

00:04:22.533 --> 00:04:24.994
Then why this destructive rampage?

00:04:25.203 --> 00:04:27.497
By demonstrating our strength,

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:33.336
we wished for you to understand
that our proposal has merit.

00:04:33.544 --> 00:04:36.756
I'm sure by now we both would
like to avoid any further losses.

00:04:36.839 --> 00:04:38.633
An offer of a cease fire?

00:04:38.799 --> 00:04:40.343
About what we expected.

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:41.427
Very well.

00:04:42.261 --> 00:04:44.722
We pledge that henceforth
the Monster Association

00:04:44.847 --> 00:04:46.224
will remain unmolested.

00:04:47.350 --> 00:04:49.644
Now release
the hostage immediately.

00:04:49.936 --> 00:04:54.065
Revel in your momentary
sense of security, vermin.

00:04:54.524 --> 00:04:57.818
Before you can extend your power,
you will all be extermin—

00:04:58.861 --> 00:05:01.239
Oops...my finger twitched.

00:05:01.531 --> 00:05:05.618
Now, now, Destrochloridium,
we're still negotiating.

00:05:05.743 --> 00:05:07.036
I'm a bad boy!

00:05:07.119 --> 00:05:08.454
I must show restraint!

00:05:08.538 --> 00:05:10.456
He's dead!

00:05:10.873 --> 00:05:14.043
Have you truly come to negotiate?!

00:05:15.628 --> 00:05:18.464
To trick grown adults is so fun!

00:05:18.673 --> 00:05:21.133
Humans and monsters "coexisting"?

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:23.469
This is truly my best prank yet!

00:05:23.553 --> 00:05:27.640
You all believed every word!
You're stupider than I thought.

00:05:28.015 --> 00:05:30.017
What will you do with the hostage?!

00:05:30.768 --> 00:05:31.852
Tell me you haven't...

00:05:31.936 --> 00:05:33.396
He's still alive.

00:05:34.230 --> 00:05:38.693
We took the hostage to ensure
you cowards can't back out.

00:05:39.235 --> 00:05:41.737
We'll give you three days only.

00:05:41.904 --> 00:05:45.032
In that time, assemble the best
the Hero Association has

00:05:45.116 --> 00:05:47.285
and come rescue the little brat.

00:05:47.577 --> 00:05:50.538
My Lord Orochi and the members
of the Monster Association

00:05:50.621 --> 00:05:52.456
await you.

00:05:56.877 --> 00:05:57.837
It exploded?!

00:05:58.004 --> 00:06:00.798
There's still one left.
What's keeping the heroes?!

00:06:00.923 --> 00:06:03.759
If we're all done talking,
I think...

00:06:04.010 --> 00:06:06.345
...I'll get a little freaky!

00:06:08.806 --> 00:06:10.766
Was that the emergency?

00:06:11.142 --> 00:06:13.019
Oh! Blackluster!

00:06:13.227 --> 00:06:16.105
Thank heavens we have you
as security for the HQ.

00:06:16.314 --> 00:06:17.815
No, it's not over!

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:19.317
That was just a husk!

00:06:19.859 --> 00:06:20.943
There's the parasite itself!

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:22.945
Slow-witted fools!

00:06:23.613 --> 00:06:27.450
Now this S-class body...
is all mine!

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:28.534
Huh?!

00:06:28.618 --> 00:06:30.453
My feeler drills are hard as steel!

00:06:30.578 --> 00:06:32.163
Why aren't they cutting
straight through you?!

00:06:33.456 --> 00:06:36.000
This is living tissue, right?!

00:06:37.543 --> 00:06:39.128
Can you even hear yourself?

00:06:39.754 --> 00:06:42.882
Everyone knows steel is no match
for a hardened body.

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:46.844
This Monster Association
is quite audacious!

00:06:46.969 --> 00:06:47.678
What now?

00:06:47.803 --> 00:06:51.307
It's obvious. Rescuing the hostage
is top priority!

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:54.518
Can we send in S-class heroes
Knowing it's a trap?

00:06:54.894 --> 00:06:56.228
This is no good.

00:06:56.520 --> 00:07:00.983
The monsters' actions have thrown
the executives into a lizzy.

00:07:01.567 --> 00:07:02.735
Better steo up.

00:07:03.319 --> 00:07:04.278
Ahem.

00:07:05.529 --> 00:07:06.530
Check me out!

00:07:09.659 --> 00:07:10.660
Well?

00:07:10.826 --> 00:07:13.621
W-What is it, Blackluster?

00:07:13.829 --> 00:07:16.916
Did seeing these muscles
calm everyone down a bit?

00:07:17.083 --> 00:07:19.085
I...guess?

00:07:19.293 --> 00:07:21.796
We're full of audacity,
same as them!

00:07:22.672 --> 00:07:26.342
It seems the time has come at last
for me to shine.

00:07:27.176 --> 00:07:29.345
Let the enemy be the ones
who tremble in fear.

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:32.515
I just hope they're tough enough
for me to go all out!

00:07:34.016 --> 00:07:35.893
Think the heroes will come?

00:07:36.060 --> 00:07:39.605
We all saw it today—
we're way stronger!

00:07:40.064 --> 00:07:41.691
Hostages are pointless.

00:07:41.816 --> 00:07:44.276
If we go all in,
they're good as dead!

00:07:44.652 --> 00:07:46.070
Boldness is a virtue,

00:07:46.237 --> 00:07:49.573
but rushing in headlong
is a strategy filled with flaws.

00:07:50.157 --> 00:07:53.202
There are freakishly strong ones
in the Hero Association, too.

00:07:53.369 --> 00:07:56.539
If we allow them to get away,
it'll mean trouble later.

00:07:56.872 --> 00:07:58.374
So we must pull them all in,

00:07:58.499 --> 00:08:00.376
then crush them
with our full force.

00:08:00.543 --> 00:08:02.753
The hostage is the bait.

00:08:03.045 --> 00:08:05.381
Once we've slain
their strongest fighters,

00:08:05.464 --> 00:08:07.383
the remainder
will be exterminated.

00:08:07.842 --> 00:08:10.302
With none left to resist us,

00:08:10.469 --> 00:08:14.724
nothing will prevent our victory
and human civilization will fall.

00:08:15.015 --> 00:08:17.768
Then Lord Orochi will reign supreme

00:08:17.893 --> 00:08:21.731
and a new world ruled by monsters
shall be born!

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:27.236
What's the matter?
I expected applause.

00:08:27.486 --> 00:08:30.072
You don't like the idea of swearing
fealty to Lord Orochi?

00:08:30.573 --> 00:08:33.993
I thought we were here
to destroy the Hero Association.

00:08:34.243 --> 00:08:36.287
Who said anything
about "fealty"?

00:08:37.246 --> 00:08:40.916
One moment. Why are there
weaklings amongst us?

00:08:43.252 --> 00:08:44.837
Hey! What're you doing?!

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:47.173
Is that you, Roach Awakening?

00:08:47.339 --> 00:08:50.009
You have the gall
to return after failure?

00:08:50.092 --> 00:08:52.678
Wait a second!
All I lost was my legs!

00:08:52.928 --> 00:08:54.221
I can still fight!

00:08:54.388 --> 00:08:55.347
Next time, I'll...

00:08:56.766 --> 00:08:58.100
Aren't we the same team?

00:08:58.225 --> 00:08:59.101
Come on!

00:08:59.185 --> 00:09:00.436
No! Stop it!

00:09:00.644 --> 00:09:03.606
Stop, please! Please stop!

00:09:06.525 --> 00:09:07.610
He ate him...

00:09:07.985 --> 00:09:09.737
And what of you, Super S?

00:09:11.947 --> 00:09:14.950
I'm still... mostly unscathed.

00:09:15.576 --> 00:09:16.911
I didn't lose!

00:09:16.994 --> 00:09:19.622
Well, she does have
a useful set of skills.

00:09:19.789 --> 00:09:22.666
It might be worth
allowing her to live.

00:09:23.834 --> 00:09:25.419
Next time, you won't be spared.

00:09:27.588 --> 00:09:28.714
Damn it all...

00:09:29.048 --> 00:09:30.299
Where was I?

00:09:30.382 --> 00:09:33.344
Anybody who's got a problem
can take it up with Lord Orochi

00:09:33.469 --> 00:09:35.095
once the battle is over.

00:09:35.304 --> 00:09:39.725
If you manage to defeat him,
you'll even be the new boss.

00:09:40.309 --> 00:09:41.101
Sounds right.

00:09:41.393 --> 00:09:46.023
By the way, Gyoro-Gyoro.
I don't see Goketsu.

00:09:47.274 --> 00:09:49.360
Now that you mention it,
he hasn't come back.

00:09:50.778 --> 00:09:52.321
I'll check on him right now.

00:09:59.995 --> 00:10:01.622
Goketsu...killed?

00:10:01.956 --> 00:10:03.332
Who could have done this?

00:10:04.625 --> 00:10:08.128
It seems my plans won't come
to fruition so easily, after all...

00:10:09.547 --> 00:10:10.506
Where am I?

00:10:11.215 --> 00:10:13.175
Did I lose a fight?

00:10:19.014 --> 00:10:21.350
Better get back
to the hideout for now...

00:10:24.311 --> 00:10:25.271
/s that...

00:10:27.273 --> 00:10:31.110
No doubt about it.
It's Death Gatling.

00:10:33.028 --> 00:10:35.906
But King roughed me up
pretty bad.

00:10:36.448 --> 00:10:38.242
My bodys at its hmit.

00:10:38.701 --> 00:10:40.536
Maybe 11! call it a day.

00:10:46.125 --> 00:10:47.334
That should do it.

00:10:48.252 --> 00:10:49.545
How's it feel, Genos?

00:10:50.045 --> 00:10:52.339
Everything seems to be
working correctly.

00:10:53.007 --> 00:10:56.552
Yes. Thank you very much,
Doctor Kuseno.

00:10:57.428 --> 00:10:58.387
Sorry for the rush.

00:10:58.721 --> 00:11:01.432
Well, you did want to get back to

00:11:01.557 --> 00:11:04.435
the front lines
as soon as possible.

00:11:04.727 --> 00:11:06.186
I made some simple modifications,

00:11:06.270 --> 00:11:10.900
but the upgrades should
certainly make you stronger.

00:11:11.317 --> 00:11:13.068
Understood. I will not lose again.

00:11:13.444 --> 00:11:15.362
No need to overdo it.

00:11:15.696 --> 00:11:17.489
It's okay to lose at times.

00:11:17.907 --> 00:11:19.700
As long as you stay alive, that is.

00:11:20.409 --> 00:11:25.331
Seeing you yesterday
reminded me of my younger days...

00:11:25.789 --> 00:11:28.167
A time when I burned with
a passion for justice

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:31.795
and dove in head first
without fear of anything.

00:11:33.255 --> 00:11:34.256
Genos...

00:11:35.591 --> 00:11:37.551
Don't do anything rash.

00:11:42.389 --> 00:11:44.266
Extra! Extra!

00:11:44.683 --> 00:11:46.268
Monster Association?!

00:11:46.352 --> 00:11:48.437
Is it true they infiltrated the HQ?

00:11:48.687 --> 00:11:50.272
It says an executive was killed!

00:11:50.439 --> 00:11:51.774
Can't they do anything?!

00:11:51.941 --> 00:11:58.113
MONSTER ASSOCIATION DECLARES WAR

00:11:59.031 --> 00:12:00.616
Will we be okay, Bat?

00:12:01.033 --> 00:12:01.659
Tch!

00:12:02.284 --> 00:12:06.372
Seems the two associations
are headed for a clash.

00:12:06.455 --> 00:12:07.623
So it's war?

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:10.793
Damn this Monster Association
and its dirty tricks!

00:12:10.960 --> 00:12:12.836
What happens to us
if the heroes lose?

00:12:13.045 --> 00:12:15.422
It hurts to admit,
but we'd be powerless.

00:12:15.756 --> 00:12:16.382
Damn it!

00:12:17.132 --> 00:12:20.886
They can win, right?
The heroes, I mean.

00:12:21.387 --> 00:12:23.764
What do you mean it doesn't
affect our strategy?

00:12:24.306 --> 00:12:27.351
Metal Knight, are you sure
you understand the situation?!

00:12:27.643 --> 00:12:29.895
If they goad us into storming in,

00:12:29.979 --> 00:12:31.563
It will only increase
our casualties.

00:12:32.314 --> 00:12:35.442
Sacrificing resources recklessly
makes no sense.

00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:38.445
This is no time for excuses!

00:12:38.696 --> 00:12:40.489
They've taken a hostage!

00:12:41.156 --> 00:12:42.950
I'm saying that
your kind of thinking

00:12:43.033 --> 00:12:44.660
will only make matters worse.

00:12:45.536 --> 00:12:47.830
Once we locate the enemy /air,

00:12:47.955 --> 00:12:50.165
we should abandon any plans
to rescue the hostage

00:12:50.416 --> 00:12:52.167
and immeatately commence
bombing.

00:12:53.085 --> 00:12:55.838
I proposed as much to the council,
but they rejected the plan.

00:12:56.422 --> 00:13:00.342
Seems they are priontizing
their own interests.

00:13:01.385 --> 00:13:05.514
And if that's the case,
I want no part of the current plan.

00:13:05.764 --> 00:13:08.809
There it is. He insists
on having it all his own way.

00:13:09.226 --> 00:13:10.477
MONSTERS DECLARE WAR

00:13:11.061 --> 00:13:14.648
The populace is watching
for our next move.

00:13:14.773 --> 00:13:17.693
That leak to the press
was no small thing.

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:20.738
Now that the public knows
about our failures,

00:13:21.363 --> 00:13:23.532
we must take a hard-line approach.

00:13:25.034 --> 00:13:26.702
The Monster Association. ...?

00:13:27.327 --> 00:13:30.456
It didn't say where to find them,
but I got an idea.

00:13:30.622 --> 00:13:31.915
DANGEROUS AREA
NO ENTRY BEYOND THIS POINT

00:13:33.292 --> 00:13:35.544
They're planning a revolution.

00:13:36.045 --> 00:13:40.007
This message wasn't meant
for the humans only.

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:41.550
They're talking to us, too.

00:13:41.967 --> 00:13:44.303
Let's join the Monster Association...

00:13:44.636 --> 00:13:48.015
and wipe those bastard heroes out!

00:13:50.476 --> 00:13:52.144
More monsters today too.

00:13:53.228 --> 00:13:55.731
Were these guys looking for me?

00:13:56.273 --> 00:13:57.357
But more importantly...

00:13:57.691 --> 00:14:00.110
The garbage truck's
about to come by!

00:14:01.528 --> 00:14:02.154
What?!

00:14:02.905 --> 00:14:05.741
Somebody's in our secret base?

00:14:06.075 --> 00:14:08.869
Yeah, some dude
is in there sleeping.

00:14:09.119 --> 00:14:10.287
Seriously?

00:14:10.913 --> 00:14:13.749
Tareo, go check it out.

00:14:13.874 --> 00:14:14.625
Huh?

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:16.335
Yell at him, then chase him away!

00:14:16.585 --> 00:14:18.921
I-| can't do that...

00:14:19.004 --> 00:14:21.090
Shut up! Just get going!

00:14:22.049 --> 00:14:23.050
That hurt...

00:14:29.431 --> 00:14:31.100
This fever's not going down.

00:14:32.184 --> 00:14:35.854
I might be out of commission
for two or three days...

00:14:36.772 --> 00:14:37.940
Who's there?!

00:14:41.235 --> 00:14:42.444
What're you up to?

00:14:42.778 --> 00:14:45.239
Th-This shack is...

00:14:46.281 --> 00:14:48.951
our secret base, so...

00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:51.286
Hey, you're...

00:14:51.745 --> 00:14:53.914
...that kid with the Hero Almanac.

00:14:54.123 --> 00:14:55.082
Huh?

00:14:56.166 --> 00:14:57.626
It's you, mister!

00:14:57.793 --> 00:15:00.129
I told you to stop
calling me mister.

00:15:00.712 --> 00:15:01.672
Why are you here?

00:15:01.964 --> 00:15:03.215
Uh...

00:15:04.049 --> 00:15:08.887
I want you to leave
this shack...please.

00:15:09.054 --> 00:15:10.013
Huh?!

00:15:10.305 --> 00:15:13.267
You're telling me to leave? Why?

00:15:13.475 --> 00:15:18.313
Um... Well, everybody told me
to tell you that.

00:15:18.397 --> 00:15:20.858
Your friends did?
Tell them to buzz off.

00:15:21.441 --> 00:15:22.484
But...

00:15:22.568 --> 00:15:24.486
Stop crying! It's annoying.

00:15:26.572 --> 00:15:27.739
Yeah, all right.

00:15:28.157 --> 00:15:30.117
I'll move to another place soon.

00:15:31.034 --> 00:15:35.289
If they have a problem with that,
bring your friends in here.

00:15:35.747 --> 00:15:37.124
Got that, little turd?

00:15:37.541 --> 00:15:38.667
G-Got it.

00:15:42.671 --> 00:15:45.007
Want some good advice?

00:15:45.757 --> 00:15:48.135
About getting respect from others?

00:15:48.343 --> 00:15:49.303
Huh?

00:15:49.386 --> 00:15:51.138
Yes. I want to know.

00:15:52.222 --> 00:15:54.349
What's keeping Tareo?

00:15:54.433 --> 00:15:56.143
Maybe something happened to him.

00:15:56.602 --> 00:15:57.978
Stand back, boys.

00:15:58.937 --> 00:16:00.856
Whoa! It's Death Gatling!

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:02.691
It's dangerous here.

00:16:03.066 --> 00:16:05.110
Smile Man and Stinger, too!

00:16:05.611 --> 00:16:09.114
Wow! A bunch of heroes are here!

00:16:09.907 --> 00:16:12.951
The hero hunter is wounded
and in that shack, huh?

00:16:13.327 --> 00:16:13.869
Yeah.

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:16.496
"Garou the Hero Hunter."

00:16:16.872 --> 00:16:19.625
Today, it's your turn
to get hunted.

00:16:20.042 --> 00:16:22.294
Excuse me...
Is there something inside?

00:16:23.545 --> 00:16:25.672
There's an evil monster
inside that shack.

00:16:26.048 --> 00:16:27.341
Get clear of here right now.

00:16:28.342 --> 00:16:29.885
Y-Yes, sir!

00:16:30.052 --> 00:16:31.220
Oh no...

00:16:31.345 --> 00:16:33.847
We made Tareo go in by himself.

00:16:34.056 --> 00:16:36.725
The heroes are here.
He'll be okay.

00:16:37.059 --> 00:16:38.060
— Right.
— Yeah.

00:16:38.894 --> 00:16:42.773
If you want respect
and not get bossed around,

00:16:44.066 --> 00:16:45.317
you gotta get strong!

00:16:45.901 --> 00:16:46.443
What?

00:16:46.777 --> 00:16:49.238
Well? Pretty good advice, eh?

00:16:49.404 --> 00:16:51.531
No, that's just obvious.

00:16:56.203 --> 00:16:57.913
Right! It /s obvious!

00:16:58.163 --> 00:17:00.249
So you do understand!

00:17:02.376 --> 00:17:03.794
Laughing makes me hurt.

00:17:04.378 --> 00:17:05.921
Are you all right, mister?

00:17:06.004 --> 00:17:06.964
Don't worry about me.

00:17:07.422 --> 00:17:09.633
You should go on home.

00:17:10.384 --> 00:17:11.551
Okay.

00:17:14.012 --> 00:17:15.013
The door's opening.

00:17:15.430 --> 00:17:16.056
Heads up!

00:17:16.598 --> 00:17:19.142
At the first sign of him,
light the place up!

00:17:20.269 --> 00:17:21.103
They're all around us.

00:17:21.478 --> 00:17:22.437
Wait!

00:17:23.397 --> 00:17:26.775
In exchange for that good advice,
let me see the Hero Almanac.

00:17:27.276 --> 00:17:28.068
You got it, yeah?

00:17:29.444 --> 00:17:31.738
I have it. But why?

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:33.615
I need a look.

00:17:33.949 --> 00:17:35.450
Okay, sure.

00:17:35.951 --> 00:17:36.910
Here.

00:17:37.577 --> 00:17:42.207
This hero almanac has comprehensive
info on the heroes, right?

00:17:42.833 --> 00:17:45.877
Yup. But not all of them.

00:17:46.128 --> 00:17:47.212
I see.

00:17:52.467 --> 00:17:56.638
CLASS A, RANK 10
STINGER
CLASS A, RANK 8
DEATH GATLING

00:17:57.264 --> 00:17:59.975
In back, two.

00:18:00.392 --> 00:18:03.061
CLASS B, RANK 43 CLASS B, RANK 99
BLAM-BLAM SHOOTER

00:18:03.312 --> 00:18:04.563
Eight in all.

00:18:05.147 --> 00:18:07.149
Ordinarily,
taking thern outd be a cinch.

00:18:07.566 --> 00:18:09.443
But with all these injuries...

00:18:10.319 --> 00:18:13.155
Luckily, this almanac
has useful information.

00:18:15.449 --> 00:18:17.492
Mister! There's someone outside!

00:18:17.576 --> 00:18:18.660
Don't talk.

00:18:18.952 --> 00:18:19.703
Tch!

00:18:19.828 --> 00:18:20.787
I'm out of time.

00:18:24.416 --> 00:18:26.376
Come on out, hero hunter!

00:18:27.169 --> 00:18:28.503
We know you're in there!

00:18:30.213 --> 00:18:32.883
Turd, get down on the floor.

00:18:33.675 --> 00:18:35.677
All right, I'm coming out!

00:18:35.802 --> 00:18:36.928
Don't shoot!

00:18:40.849 --> 00:18:43.477
Do me a favor and don't
shoot up the shack.

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:45.562
Aren't you sweet.
Turning yourself in?

00:18:45.687 --> 00:18:46.646
Don't be stupid.

00:18:47.439 --> 00:18:49.733
I just need a place
to catch up on sleep

00:18:49.858 --> 00:18:51.777
after I hunt you bastards down.

00:18:51.902 --> 00:18:53.528
After you hunt us down'?!

00:18:53.737 --> 00:18:55.822
Don't fall for his taunts,
Wildhorn.

00:18:56.448 --> 00:18:58.033
He's in pretty bad shape.

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:01.203
We'll take him alive and
bring him back to the Association.

00:19:01.411 --> 00:19:03.497
Under questioning,
he'll tell us his motives...

00:19:04.122 --> 00:19:05.791
...and give up any accomplices!

00:19:06.041 --> 00:19:07.626
That's a hero for you.

00:19:08.043 --> 00:19:10.712
You're very kind not to kill me.

00:19:10.879 --> 00:19:12.047
Wow!

00:19:12.214 --> 00:19:13.173
Heroes!

00:19:13.548 --> 00:19:15.384
And theyre really tough ones, too!

00:19:15.592 --> 00:19:19.137
You won't get off easy.
You'll have to pay.

00:19:19.346 --> 00:19:22.349
We'll make you regret ever
calling yourself a monster.

00:19:22.974 --> 00:19:23.892
You got it backwards.

00:19:24.267 --> 00:19:26.436
You're the ones who'll pay
for calling yourselves "heroes."

00:19:36.029 --> 00:19:37.280
Time to hunt!

00:19:37.447 --> 00:19:40.742
And you guys are gonna
put me over 100 kills!

00:19:41.368 --> 00:19:43.245
It's the end of the line for you!

00:19:45.205 --> 00:19:47.416
I'm taking you down first!

00:19:50.419 --> 00:19:52.421
He did that airborne?! Amazing.

00:19:52.879 --> 00:19:54.172
That was pretty close.

00:19:54.256 --> 00:19:56.258
He wasnt trying to take me alive.

00:19:57.342 --> 00:19:58.301
Arrow Rain!

00:19:59.719 --> 00:20:02.597
How'd he know?
Arrow Rain is my secret technique!

00:20:02.764 --> 00:20:04.307
Those are poison arrows.

00:20:04.891 --> 00:20:06.726
Good thing I read the almanac.

00:20:06.810 --> 00:20:11.440
Why are heroes after you, mister?

00:20:11.773 --> 00:20:14.276
Despite the odds,
he isn't backing down...

00:20:14.609 --> 00:20:16.695
Is the Hero Hunter
just a damn fool?

00:20:16.778 --> 00:20:21.116
Chain Toad, both Tank-top Master
and Metal Bat were badly beaten.

00:20:22.075 --> 00:20:25.162
Remember what we discussed
about Garou?

00:20:25.620 --> 00:20:28.790
"Never underestimate him."
I got it.

00:20:29.166 --> 00:20:30.500
I won't go easy on him!

00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:48.935
I can believe he was
Silverfang's top disciple.

00:20:49.186 --> 00:20:50.604
And he's no fool.

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:52.439
His senses are frighteningly sharp.

00:20:53.482 --> 00:20:54.774
At middle distance,

00:20:54.858 --> 00:20:58.111
Chain Toad and Smileman launch
a ceaseless barrage of attacks...

00:21:03.158 --> 00:21:04.493
Got him! Two hits!

00:21:04.826 --> 00:21:06.286
But if I back off too far,

00:21:06.536 --> 00:21:08.788
I'm in Shooter and Blam-Blam's
tield of fire.

00:21:09.456 --> 00:21:11.166
With Death Gatling on clean up, eh?

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:15.253
So what's that guy been up to
all this time?

00:21:15.337 --> 00:21:16.379
Shooter!

00:21:16.505 --> 00:21:17.255
Thanks!

00:21:17.339 --> 00:21:18.757
He's here in support.

00:21:19.174 --> 00:21:22.093
That explains why he keot
his distance from me.

00:21:22.636 --> 00:21:23.637
In that case...

00:21:24.554 --> 00:21:27.182
Youre gonna be my meatshield!

00:21:27.557 --> 00:21:28.141
Stay there!

00:21:29.059 --> 00:21:30.018
Damn.

00:21:30.644 --> 00:21:33.480
/f I leave myself any more exposed,
I get shot in the back.

00:21:35.482 --> 00:21:36.233
Little shit...

00:21:37.067 --> 00:21:41.279
It's my job to chase you down
if you run.

00:21:41.905 --> 00:21:43.406
In terms of stamina
and persistence,

00:21:43.532 --> 00:21:44.533
you won't beat me.

00:21:45.534 --> 00:21:48.995
You're wounded and poisoned.
You can't hold out long.

00:21:49.246 --> 00:21:51.623
But the close-in fighting
is their job.

00:21:54.376 --> 00:21:57.254
I dont have the legs
to break through them.

00:21:57.754 --> 00:21:59.214
In the shape I'm in,

00:21:59.297 --> 00:22:02.384
I'd be a fool to think I can
avoid all their bullets, arrows,

00:22:02.509 --> 00:22:04.094
and other weapons...

00:22:04.594 --> 00:22:08.390
This is your final chance
to surrender, Garou!

00:22:26.324 --> 00:22:31.288
We painted different dreams
into our hearts

00:22:31.413 --> 00:22:36.084
With the struggles that we faced
In the past

00:22:36.626 --> 00:22:42.090
Will the future call
or Will it slip away?

00:22:42.257 --> 00:22:47.095
There's just so much
that we dont know.

00:22:47.429 --> 00:22:52.601
But one day, well make peace
within ourselves

00:22:52.892 --> 00:22:58.273
Weil be able to forgive
everything in our past

00:22:58.398 --> 00:23:03.445
We tell ourselves to forget,
but nothing seems to fade

00:23:03.612 --> 00:23:07.574
That's what we are to each other.

00:23:07.657 --> 00:23:13.955
If you hold out your hand
Youll see the bonds that show us

00:23:14.122 --> 00:23:18.460
That kindness Is the true strength

00:23:18.585 --> 00:23:24.924
Theyre something that I need
To keep on moving on

00:23:25.050 --> 00:23:30.305
So I promise that I'll come back

00:23:30.430 --> 00:23:36.227
I promise that Ill come back to you.

00:23:45.654 --> 00:23:50.283
THE VARIETIES OF PRIDE
